  "description": "GameFrameX.Capability.Online.Operations,GFX Online 运营聚合能力包(分析面冻结:游戏事件/总览/时间线不删除、不演进,数据面契约留服务端,查询 UI 归运营台;Hotfix 回滚为遗留活面):统一审计/Hotfix 回滚 + 事件桥与审计桥装配(机制事件总线逐主题订阅)+ 自装配模块(OnlineOperationsCapabilityModule,Options=OnlineOperationsOptions)+ admin handlers(Console 三 action). Operations aggregate capability package for the GFX Online family (frozen analysis face: game events, overview and timeline are neither removed nor evolved; hotfix rollback remains the active surface): unified audit, hotfix rollback and the event/audit bridge wiring over the mechanism event bus, the self-assembling capability module and admin handlers. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com",
